WEBVTT

01:24.100 --> 01:29.980
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

01:58.220 --> 01:59.960
Welcome!

02:05.260 --> 02:07.800
<i>I just joined the workforce this spring.</i>

02:09.410 --> 02:12.400
<i>I was so looking forward to living 
on my own the first time.</i>

02:13.150 --> 02:17.100
<i>At the end of the day, 
I'd go out drinking with coworkers.</i>

02:18.010 --> 02:20.080
<i>I'd even go to the gym.</i>

02:20.070 --> 02:21.720
<b>Yomiuri Travel</b>

02:20.070 --> 02:25.220
<b>Seasonal Travel</b>

02:20.070 --> 02:25.470
Visit Lovely Islands

02:20.070 --> 02:26.600
Overseas Vistas

02:20.670 --> 02:23.800
<i>On my days off, I'd visit all 
sorts of places for fun...</i>

02:24.650 --> 02:27.090
<i>At least, that was the plan.</i>

02:27.710 --> 02:30.660
<i>But I just don't have the energy.</i>

02:30.980 --> 02:34.880
<i>If I don't stay home and do laundry,
 I won't have any underwear.</i>

02:34.880 --> 02:37.420
<b>Seaweed Lunch (Fish Paste)</b>

02:35.460 --> 02:37.420
<i>I also wanted to cook for myself,</i>

02:38.330 --> 02:40.790
<i>but when I get home,
I can't even manage that.</i>

02:40.790 --> 02:44.750
<i>I can't keep living like this.
It's too expensive.</i>

02:45.140 --> 02:49.190
<i>Yet I end up giving in anyway,
then get depressed over how much I suck.</i>

02:47.220 --> 02:49.180
<b>Super Energy Jelly</b>

02:47.220 --> 02:49.180
<b>Super Energy Jelly</b>

02:47.220 --> 02:49.180
<b>Super Energy Jelly</b>

02:50.290 --> 02:53.650
<i>Sorry. Even failures get hungry.</i>

03:00.150 --> 03:04.580
grind grind grind

03:02.360 --> 03:04.580
grind

03:08.040 --> 03:10.870
grind grind grind grind grind grind grind grind

03:08.510 --> 03:09.960
<i>Holy...!</i>

03:11.150 --> 03:14.930
<i>So what they say about dangerous
 people downtown is true!</i>

03:14.920 --> 03:18.920
grind grind grind grind grind grind grind

03:15.470 --> 03:17.430
<i>I'll have to keep my distance.</i>

03:18.920 --> 03:19.440
grind grind grind grind grind grind

03:20.030 --> 03:21.780
Oh, it's you.

03:21.780 --> 03:23.250
Welcome!

03:24.050 --> 03:26.030
<i>He's on good terms with the clerk?</i>

03:26.030 --> 03:27.140
<i>That's odd.</i>

03:27.140 --> 03:31.220
I have a question. Where did 
the Chinese bun case go?

03:31.790 --> 03:35.510
The promotion period ended,
so we had to take it down.

03:36.510 --> 03:39.130
We only had them until early April.

03:40.630 --> 03:41.930
Oh...

03:42.330 --> 03:44.530
<i>That is some serious disappointment!</i>

03:44.530 --> 03:46.380
I-I'm so sorry!

03:46.380 --> 03:49.250
I know that was your go-to treat after work.

03:49.800 --> 03:50.770
Yeah.

03:51.310 --> 03:55.990
<i>I guess I'm not the only one who hits the 
convenience store on the way home from work.</i>

03:56.540 --> 03:59.930
It was my reward for a hard day's work.

04:00.590 --> 04:03.140
I needed it to get me through.

04:04.800 --> 04:07.960
It's important to reward yourself!

04:07.960 --> 04:13.050
We may not have those buns anymore,
but we got some new frozen treats!

04:13.050 --> 04:15.420
What did you just say?

04:16.280 --> 04:18.440
I'd like to hear more about it.

04:18.440 --> 04:19.910
Follow me!

04:24.480 --> 04:25.920
<i>A reward?</i>

04:26.640 --> 04:31.080
<i>I was so focused on the negative, 
I never thought of it that way.</i>

04:34.390 --> 04:40.470
<i>Even if there are things I can't do,
maybe I should just celebrate working hard.</i>

04:44.590 --> 04:47.340
<b>Pudding</b>

04:44.590 --> 04:47.340
<b>Super Energy Jelly</b>

04:44.590 --> 04:47.340
<b>Seaweed Lunch (Fish Paste)</b>

04:47.350 --> 04:50.150
Here's to another day of good work!

04:50.720 --> 04:53.680
What?! Oh, uh, thanks.

04:54.790 --> 04:56.980
Thanks for stopping by!

04:58.230 --> 05:00.090
<i>I bought some pudding!</i>

05:06.520 --> 05:09.720
<i>I'm a hard worker! Go me!</i>

05:11.410 --> 05:13.830
<b>Another day</b>

05:21.120 --> 05:22.860
Welcome!

05:27.680 --> 05:28.820
<b>NEW</b>

05:27.680 --> 05:28.820
<b>NEW</b>

05:27.680 --> 05:29.070
<b>NEW</b>

05:27.680 --> 05:29.200
<b>Sakura Pudding</b>

05:27.680 --> 05:29.200
<b>NEW</b>

05:27.680 --> 05:29.640
<b>Pudding</b>

05:27.680 --> 05:29.640
<b>Sakura Pudding</b>

05:27.680 --> 05:29.640
<b>Sakura Pudding</b>

05:27.680 --> 05:29.640
Eclairs

05:27.680 --> 05:29.640
Sakura Roll Cake

05:27.680 --> 05:29.640
<b>NEW</b>

05:27.680 --> 05:29.640
<b>NEW</b>

05:27.680 --> 05:29.640
<b>NEW</b>

05:29.640 --> 05:32.490
<b>Rice ball fillings
you're sure to love</b>

05:29.640 --> 05:34.100
<b>Freshly brewed coffee</b>

05:31.090 --> 05:33.550
Oh, we just got those in.

05:34.110 --> 05:36.800
We're running a cherry 
blossom-themed promotion,

05:36.800 --> 05:41.280
so we have sakura mochi, sakura roll cake, 
sakura ice cream, sakura lattes,

05:41.640 --> 05:43.920
and sakura-flavored milk tea!

05:47.570 --> 05:51.780
I-Is this any good?

05:52.210 --> 05:53.980
I love it!

05:58.050 --> 05:59.370
I'll get one.

05:59.370 --> 06:00.490
Great!

06:07.540 --> 06:09.860
So this is what cherry blossoms taste like?

06:34.950 --> 06:40.960
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

06:34.950 --> 06:40.960
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

06:45.960 --> 06:49.430
<b><i>Hot Snacks</i></b>

06:45.960 --> 06:49.430
<b>Freshly brewed coffee</b>

06:45.960 --> 06:49.430
<b>Rice ball fillings
you're sure to love</b>

06:49.420 --> 06:53.380
What should today's treat be?

06:58.570 --> 07:00.620
Oh, welcome!

07:01.870 --> 07:03.720
Ah, it's you.

07:03.720 --> 07:07.350
I was just wondering
 if you might not make it today.

07:07.910 --> 07:11.240
<i>It's that clerk and Mr. Tough Guy.</i>

07:11.240 --> 07:13.830
<i>They sure do seem to get along well.</i>

07:14.350 --> 07:16.030
You know what?

07:21.950 --> 07:25.430
We got in some new ice cream products!

07:28.350 --> 07:30.810
Please tell me more.

07:30.810 --> 07:31.840
Mhm!

07:37.220 --> 07:39.940
<i>Staring too much would be rude.</i>

07:43.570 --> 07:46.370
This is our new lineup.

07:46.370 --> 07:48.900
I'd especially recommend this one!

07:48.900 --> 07:52.530
It's rich soft serve loaded with fruit!

07:52.530 --> 07:57.760
And look! We've got two flavors: strawberry
adzuki and banana molasses kinako.

07:57.760 --> 08:00.360
Not only do they both taste great,

08:00.040 --> 08:04.710
<b>Banana Molasses
Kinako Soft Serve</b>

08:00.360 --> 08:04.720
but I think they also make
 for one hearty snack!

08:00.890 --> 08:04.710
<b>Strawberry Adzuki Soft Serve</b>

08:05.070 --> 08:08.210
Yes, they both look delicious.

08:08.210 --> 08:10.370
<i>She sure got my attention.</i>

08:10.750 --> 08:14.750
<i>Strawberry adzuki and 
banana molasses kinako?</i>

08:14.840 --> 08:17.970
<b>Banana Molasses
Kinako Soft Serve</b>

08:14.840 --> 08:17.970
<b>Strawberry Adzuki Soft Serve</b>

08:15.350 --> 08:17.350
If I had to choose, I'd go with...

08:18.190 --> 08:20.420
Banana molasses kinako.

08:18.190 --> 08:20.420
Strawberry adzuki!

08:20.420 --> 08:22.680
<i>They're at odds!</i>

08:26.950 --> 08:29.390
<i>There I go again!</i>

08:29.390 --> 08:30.840
I-I'm sorry!

08:30.840 --> 08:34.640
I was so sure you'd prefer the strawberry,
 I couldn't stop myself!

08:35.010 --> 08:38.420
<i>What'll we do if Mr. Tough Guy gets angry?</i>

08:39.490 --> 08:40.400
Don't worry.

08:40.670 --> 08:44.130
Your recommendations are 
always on the money.

08:44.130 --> 08:48.120
Why don't I buy both and do a taste test?

08:48.380 --> 08:50.140
Oh, wow!

08:50.140 --> 08:53.700
I-I'm sorry!
I didn't mean to make you get two!

08:53.700 --> 08:54.840
It's fine.

08:54.840 --> 08:58.680
Chances are I would've just come back 
another day to buy the other one.

08:59.100 --> 09:00.650
Ring me up.

09:00.650 --> 09:02.060
Y-Yes, sir!

09:13.020 --> 09:15.260
<i>For today's treat,</i>

09:15.260 --> 09:18.030
<i>maybe I'll get some of this ice cream too.</i>

09:18.740 --> 09:22.790
<i>Now, strawberry adzuki or 
banana molasses kinako?</i>

09:26.470 --> 09:28.450
Thank you so much!

09:32.020 --> 09:33.690
Take care!

09:35.220 --> 09:36.640
I know!

09:36.630 --> 09:38.890
<b>Strawberry Adzuki Soft Serve</b>

09:36.630 --> 09:38.890
<b>Banana Molasses
Kinako Soft Serve</b>

09:39.860 --> 09:41.590
Thank you very much!

09:41.590 --> 09:42.370
Sure!

09:49.120 --> 09:52.600
Now then, which shall I try first?

09:52.880 --> 09:55.500
Tomorrow is my first day off in a while.

09:55.500 --> 09:58.150
There'll be plenty of time for indecision.

10:00.890 --> 10:10.480
<i>I'm a high-ranking officer of the Evil League,
which fights daily to wipe out humankind</i>

10:10.480 --> 10:16.530
<i>and claim the Earth in the 
name of our home planet.</i>

10:16.530 --> 10:19.740
<i>But today is my day off.</i>

10:21.130 --> 10:27.110
<i>I'm visiting a place called a café
 in search of a thing called "latte art."</i>

10:32.880 --> 10:34.230
Welcome.

10:44.770 --> 10:46.940
<i>What is that?</i>

10:46.940 --> 10:49.530
<i>Some kind of experimental instrument?</i>

10:49.900 --> 10:51.370
What can I get you?

10:51.370 --> 10:53.080
One of these.

10:53.080 --> 10:54.730
Coming right up.

10:59.920 --> 11:02.260
<i>What's he going to do?</i>

11:10.250 --> 11:12.480
Wh-What is that?!

11:12.480 --> 11:14.260
A siphon coffee maker.

11:14.260 --> 11:17.890
Pour-over coffee is nice too, 
but our café's always done it this way.

11:22.280 --> 11:23.890
Thank you for waiting.

11:26.770 --> 11:31.460
<i>So there's more than 
one way to make coffee...</i>

11:34.170 --> 11:36.060
<i>What now?</i>

11:36.370 --> 11:38.420
<i>What is that sound?!</i>

11:38.420 --> 11:41.660
<i>What the hell is that guy doing?</i>

11:41.660 --> 11:46.000
<i>He has to make all that noise
 just to make coffee?</i>

11:49.310 --> 11:51.090
Thanks for waiting.

11:52.680 --> 11:54.510
Take your time and enjoy.

12:03.220 --> 12:07.040
<i>Looks just as charming as the rumors say.</i>

12:15.340 --> 12:18.860
<i>How does one go about drinking this?</i>

12:34.130 --> 12:37.630
<i>Wh-What's the meaning of this?</i>

12:39.100 --> 12:43.750
<i>The more I drink, the less panda it becomes!</i>

12:49.860 --> 12:51.570
<i>Latte art...</i>

12:51.570 --> 12:54.460
<i>What a merciless beverage!</i>

12:57.260 --> 12:58.440
<i>It's all right.</i>

13:00.530 --> 13:03.290
<i>This is our destiny.</i>

13:30.870 --> 13:34.150
<i>O panda!</i>

13:48.980 --> 13:50.140
Barista.

13:50.610 --> 13:54.070
Another panda latte for 
this customer over here.

13:54.400 --> 13:55.500
Sure.

14:11.560 --> 14:16.840
I got so worked up over that panda
 latte that I bought too much.

14:17.370 --> 14:20.240
<i>It's so heavy it's about 
to dislocate my shoulder.</i>

14:20.710 --> 14:23.520
<i>After all, I'm carrying...</i>

14:29.160 --> 14:37.260
<i>a massive amount of milk for making 
stew, pudding, and almond jelly!</i>

14:38.600 --> 14:42.890
<i>Stew is, of course,
 delicious in and of itself.</i>

14:42.890 --> 14:46.810
<i>But rice gratin, pasta, and omelet rice...</i>

14:47.630 --> 14:51.110
<i>It can be used in such 
a wide range of cuisine.</i>

14:51.470 --> 14:55.530
<i>Starting next week, I have 
to work a bunch of days in a row.</i>

14:55.530 --> 14:58.580
<i>It'll be worth it to cook 
some meals in advance.</i>

14:59.160 --> 15:05.550
<i>Once the pudding and almond jelly are done, 
I'll top them with panda decorations.</i>

15:05.810 --> 15:10.450
<i>I had the idea 
while drinking that panda latte.</i>

15:11.020 --> 15:14.270
<i>Today, I embark on a trial run.</i>

15:14.720 --> 15:20.390
<i>I anticipate some degree of failure,
 so I bought extra milk.</i>

15:20.780 --> 15:24.360
<i>And for the arrangement of all this food,</i>

15:24.360 --> 15:29.000
<i>I'll use the panda dishware I 
stumbled across by blind luck!</i>

15:56.070 --> 15:59.980
<i>I've managed to make it back to my building,</i>

16:00.500 --> 16:03.210
<i>yet one final hurdle remains...</i>

16:03.620 --> 16:05.350
<i>The stairs!</i>

16:07.730 --> 16:12.310
<i>Why won't you install an 
elevator, Earthlings?!</i>

16:12.980 --> 16:14.380
<i>Nevertheless...</i>

16:16.920 --> 16:20.950
<i>I won't be defeated here!</i>

16:25.300 --> 16:27.870
<i>With each step I take,</i>

16:28.310 --> 16:33.410
<i>these bags bite into my shoulders and hands!</i>

16:34.450 --> 16:36.680
<i>What spiritually taxing toil!</i>

16:37.420 --> 16:40.330
<i>My fingers are about to tear off.</i>

16:41.240 --> 16:44.610
<i>Once I reach the top of these stairs,</i>

16:45.250 --> 16:48.580
<i>I'll start by making stew,</i>

16:49.740 --> 16:52.830
<i>and I'll put it in my panda bowl!</i>

16:53.460 --> 16:54.890
<i>Stay strong.</i>

16:55.200 --> 16:57.080
<i>Don't give up!</i>

16:57.530 --> 17:01.170
<i>You hear me, legs and shoulders?!</i>

17:01.170 --> 17:05.880
<i>I see it now—the end of my long journey!</i>

17:34.060 --> 17:35.220
Hello.

17:36.190 --> 17:37.340
Hi.

17:39.990 --> 17:46.000
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

17:39.990 --> 17:46.000
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

17:48.950 --> 18:00.330
<i>I'm a high-ranking officer of the Evil League,
which fights daily to wipe out humankind</i>

18:00.330 --> 18:04.010
<i>and claim the Earth in the 
name of our home planet.</i>

18:04.240 --> 18:07.490
<i>But today is my day off.</i>

18:08.930 --> 18:14.120
<i>I've come to see the cherry blossoms
as the Earthlings so love to do...</i>

18:14.890 --> 18:19.030
<i>But the flowers have already fallen.</i>

18:21.260 --> 18:25.540
<i>I even went to the trouble 
of packing a lunch for this.</i>

18:26.140 --> 18:29.780
<i>Seeing cherry blossoms just isn't the same
 without a picnic lunch, you know?</i>

19:28.310 --> 19:35.520
munch\h\h
\h\hmunch
munch\h
\h\hmunch

19:28.610 --> 19:34.630
Hey, hasn't your family ever taught you 
not to accept food from strangers?

19:38.330 --> 19:40.700
You were just <i>that</i> hungry?

19:42.540 --> 19:44.540
Some planet this is.

19:45.330 --> 19:49.580
But fret not. I'll wipe out humanity for sure.

19:49.990 --> 19:51.570
One more?

19:51.570 --> 19:53.590
Have as much as you'd like.

19:55.430 --> 19:57.970
You here to see the flowers, mister?

19:58.660 --> 19:59.590
Yeah.

20:00.700 --> 20:02.780
Though it seems I'm too late.

20:05.610 --> 20:07.400
Be sure to chew thoroughly.

20:08.310 --> 20:10.180
I'll show them to you.

20:23.730 --> 20:30.910
<i>Unlike the flora of my home planet, 
which retain their flowers until they wither,</i>

20:30.910 --> 20:37.040
<i>this cherry blossom tree scatters 
its petals shortly after they bloom.</i>

20:37.830 --> 20:43.600
<i>Humans supposedly find the spectacle elegant.</i>

21:05.410 --> 21:09.750
I see now. 
Seeing them fall truly is beautiful.

21:19.410 --> 21:20.920
Did she go home?

21:22.130 --> 21:26.510
<i>After that, I went back several 
times with a packed lunch,</i>

21:27.300 --> 21:30.230
<i>but I did not encounter that child.</i>

21:36.710 --> 21:43.020
<i>Perhaps I'll go again next year 
when the flowers are in bloom.</i>

23:20.000 --> 23:20.790
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

23:20.000 --> 23:20.790
<b>MR. VILLAIN'S DAY OFF</b>

23:22.250 --> 23:26.190
What does she dress up to go fight?

23:27.250 --> 23:31.180
Even once the uniform comes off, 
she can't be true to herself.

23:32.270 --> 23:38.140
A throbbing heart, impossible to conceal 
in the midst of natural color...

23:38.920 --> 23:43.700
There was a fake smile on her revealed face...

23:44.230 --> 23:47.200
That magical girl in distress.

23:48.320 --> 23:49.940
Magical Girl in Distress.
